   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support to MRG, Minority Rights Group, based in London, 2001-2003. It&apos;s a continuation of previous support. MRG work for the right of minorities, supporting lokal organisations and doing lobbying in the UN and other international bodies. The also have a programme on how to mainstream minority rights into development cooperation.</narrative>
